## Activity board
![Activity board](01-activity-board.png)
Use the exact user-reviewed image as a visual reference, subject to these reservations:
- Global top panel and Activity board toolbar are DISTINCT panels. Restore the global panel; put the Activity board view selector and its tools/search in the board's own toolbar. Share the reusable toolbar component, not one merged instance.
- Reduce outer padding, margins and per-level indentation. Retain hierarchy guide lines; horizontal space belongs to cards.
- The task-with-children icon in the image is wrong. Consolidate the child/derived-state affordance with the stage dropdown as appropriate, preserving access to children. Parent state is computed at least partly from children/descendants; specify and enforce the invariants before implementation, not arbitrary direct parent edits.
- Avatars lead metadata on Inputs, Active and Closed. Inputs have no priority; task priority and avatar persist after closure, even if the image omits a value.
- Add adjustable vertical splitters BETWEEN Inputs/Active/Closed columns, in addition to horizontal splitters between the four independently scrolling Active sections.
- Preserve agreed New/Later/time groups and sorting/inheritance rules; see readiness audit. No card ellipsis controls.

## Node editor
![Node editor](02-node-editor.png)
- Headers span the entire pane width, including the invariant gutter; image width variations are noise.
- Use shared theme tokens consistently; incidental colors/background mismatches are not design decisions.
- Global and board toolbars remain separate here too.
- Fields/Additional relations have a splitter. Intra-field border color pairs with inline comment. Inter-field diagnostics use edge color plus hover/focus comment. Neutral connections use one gray style; no full-height gray rails.
- Single-column fields; help chip between label and type. Inheritance source is in the Inherited/Overridden tooltip, dropdown controls overrides.
- Illustrative validation rules and Closed/Outcome fields do not approve an invented task schema.
- No unsaved-change label.

## Search/autocomplete
![Autocomplete](03-autocomplete.png)
- Popup matches search width regardless of content, with left-aligned content and minimal pointer travel. Enforce at shared component level.
- Choose either separators between every row or none; never a hybrid. Proposed default: none.
- No heading/instruction footer rows. Only one autocomplete context at a time.
- Saved-query choices are flat for MVP; folders from previous rounds are superseded.
- Preserve distinct global and Activity board toolbars. Search belongs to the latter.

